1. openclaw-jarvis-ui (orb visualizer port)
-------------------------------------------
The Three.js orb in ui/src/visualizer/ (wireframe icosahedron with simplex-
noise vertex displacement, the backside additive Fresnel glow shell, and the
background particle field) is ported from:

  https://github.com/jincocodev/openclaw-jarvis-ui
  (src/core/scene.js — createAnomalyObject / createBackgroundParticles,
   and the thinking-state activity shaping in updateAnomaly)

whose README credits its own origin: "Based on the Three.js Orb Visualizer
(https://codepen.io/filipz/pen/yyyRgry) by Filip Zrnzevic — original concept,
3D orb design, and audio visualization. Adapted into an OpenClaw agent
dashboard by Jincoco." Credit for the original orb-visualizer concept and
design belongs to Filip Zrnzevic.

The inlined 3D simplex noise GLSL is the classic Ashima Arts / Ian McEwan
webgl-noise implementation (MIT), as carried by the upstream shader.

